  # The bow leans harder than it did. With the string's own offset blocked
  # the friction curve has to do all the work, and at 0.55 it did not start
  # one: the patch measured as broadband noise at 3900 Hz with the string
  # barely in it. At 0.85 the centroid falls to 1163 Hz, which is a string.
  pressure       0.85
